# Bird

A separate model. Do not touch `Human`, `BalanceController`, or the
`HeadlessTrial` stand.

Layer: body `Bird`, actuators `Muscle` / `JointFriction` (ragdoll only),
flight `BirdFlight` + drag `BodyAero`, sensor `BirdSensors`,
control `BirdController`. Who sets `mode` (the brain) is
`.cursor/rules/ai.mdc`; this file is flap and landing physics, not
behavior.

## Handshake with agent `ai`

Colleague: profile `ai`, law `.cursor/rules/ai.mdc`. They write **what**
the bird wants. This profile writes **how** the body flies.

| | Agent `ai` | Agent `bird` (this file) |
|---|---|---|
| Writes | `mode` / `SetFacing` (`BirdDrive`, `BirdWander`, `BirdFlockDrive`) | lift, flap, `walkThrust`, PD, perch, pose |
| Must not write | `AddForce`, `BirdFlight` formula, `flapFrequency` | `FactionMember`, vision/hearing, fear of a human |
| Sensors | world see/hear (own layer, later) | `BirdSensors` — inner ear and feet, not eyes |

Do not invent `BirdIntent`, `Vision`, `Hearing`, or `FactionMember` here.

`takeoffDelay` Stand→Fly is a **demo timer**, not the brain. Flock
landing in `TickFlock` may set `mode = Sit` and zero the delay —
that is contact rest, not faction. `BirdDrive` (card `BIRD-2`) decides
in `Update`; it must not fight the landing write in the same physics
step (`sitHold` after touchdown).

Flock eye origin later is the **body** (`headVisual` has no
`Rigidbody2D`). Ragdoll eye origin is `Head`. Facing is
`BirdController.facing` (±1): ahead is that sign along X, not a street
left/right. Do not use `CameraFollow` or `Light2D` as sight.

Turn (flock): do **not** `localScale` the `Rigidbody2D` / perch and do
**not** rotate the body 180° (legs would point at the sky). Put neck,
wings, tail, legs under `Look` and set `lookRoot.localScale.x = facing`.
Thrust heading is `Rot(pitch) * (facing, 0)`; pitch goal is
`target * facing` (+8° right, −8° left). Walk thrust uses the same sign.
Ragdoll stay +X until a card. CLI: `-birdFacing` / `-birdTurnAfter`.
Play: `Bird` / `BirdFlock50` default `birdDriveKind` wander (BIRD-3 / BIRD-4).
Dirt forage: brain writes Glide then Walk/Peck (`BirdWander` phase
Forage). Body already sinks (`glideSink` / dirt land flap) and nods
Peck. Do not teleport Sit. Do not invent `BirdMode.Forage`.
