CLI `-birdKind chicken`.
Every kind has a `Beak` segment (card `BIRD-8-beak`). Ragdoll: hinge
on the head. Flock: look child + trigger, no extra `Rigidbody2D`.
Hits go through `BeakStrike` only — not a wing, not the chest.
Stand: `run-trial.ps1 -Rebuild -Duration 10 -Label bird_stand -Extra @('-bird','1')`.
Without `-bird` the human path does not change. `-takeoffDelay 0` —
stance without takeoff. `-birdMode fly` — flap and thrust.
`-birdRig flock` — flock build. `-stopFlap 4` — drop the flap at the
4th second (glide by default). `-stopFlapMode glide|stand`.
`-walkThrust` — flock step. `-birdFacing 1|-1`. `-birdTurnAfter`.
`-birdMode sit|attack`. Play drive: `birdDrive` on `Bird` / `BirdFlock50`.

## Budget (optimization 02.09)

Read `Trials/Runs/opt_bird_code_02.md` and `opt_agent_proposals.md`
(section bird). Not a GO card. PERF-5 is closed.

Flock N=50 at 200 Hz is the **solver edge** (`wallPerSim ≈ 1`), not
empty `FixedUpdate` and not `NearPerch`. One ragdoll is 17 RB / 32
muscles / 16 frictions — hero budget, stance stand only.

Do not:

- Cut `flapFrequency`, `aiStride`, or 200 Hz for FPS.
- Move `BirdFlight.Tick` to `Update`.
- Disable driven `BirdSensors` / `BirdFlight` again (0% on two repeats).
- Spawn ragdoll birds in `BirdFlock50` or World (`birdCount = 0`).
- Replace the foot probe with `GetContacts` while `probeSat` is 0.

Perch lab already answered the optional probe card:
`perf_flock_metric_tree1` — `probeSaturatedFraction` **0**,
`meanProbeHits` 0.54, 3774 probes / 20 s. Keep `OverlapBoxNonAlloc`
and the cruise skip. `NearPerch` stays one AABB; sensors cache
`nearPerch` once per tick.
